    <string name="onboarding_page1_title">Speak, and it\'s done</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page1_body">Record a note using the Tile on your watch, or tap the microphone button in the app. Your note is recognized and processed automatically.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page2_title">Automatically sorted</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page2_body">Start with a keyword and the app knows what it is. "Groceries milk" lands in your shopping list. "Reminder tomorrow dentist" schedules a reminder.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page3_title">Reminder by time or place</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page3_body">The app can remind you at a set time or when you arrive somewhere — home, work, or the supermarket. Your shopping list appears automatically when you enter a supermarket. A few permissions are needed for this.</string>
